    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know it's risky but my nephrologist is super hard to get a hold of and it's like me calling the office every time i have a cramp. i just want to feel better now. if i just took a small amount, like maybe just one 99mg pill once a day, wouldn't that be safe enough to just see if it helps the cramping? it's a pretty low dose right?",
