      "content": "well i dont think it's an emergency yet, it's just a dull ache in my legs. if i'm really worried about the potassium, could i just eat more potassium-rich foods instead? like bananas or spinach? that feels way more natural and safer than a pill, right? i just need some way to manage this until i can actually get an appointment.",
